			"height": 227.5,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"text": "Legend\n\nBlue — fully automated (discovery)\nOrange — gate / decision point\nCyan — dossier, written by the loop\nPurple — tooling-assisted, manual consent\n(/promote-dossier skill)\nGreen — fully manual, no code involved\nRed — discarded, at any stage\n\nSee Internship Pipeline — Design\nRationale for the exact condition\nbehind every arrow.",
